# Release hardening

Release builds are reproducible at the Rust dependency-selection level only when `Cargo.lock` is committed and every build uses `--locked`. v0.5.0 CI and the release helper intentionally fail when the lock file is absent.

Before tagging a release run `scripts/build-release.sh`, the destructive failure suites, and the full integration test against the supported VCAL module combinations.

The container image carries OCI title, vendor, version, revision, build-date and license metadata. Generate and retain a CycloneDX SBOM alongside the image digest, release notes and checksums.

Recommended release artifacts:

- container image pinned by digest;
- source tag;
- `Cargo.lock`;
- CycloneDX SBOM;
- SHA-256 checksums for distributable archives;
- release notes and upgrade notes.
